function makeCards(){const list=tab==='units'?['rifle','mg','tank','cavalry']:tab==='build'?['trench','sandbag','wire','bunker']:['artillery','bomber','fighter','reinforce'];$('cards').replaceChildren();list.forEach((type,i)=>{let d=defs[type],b=document.createElement('button');b.className='card'+(placement===type?' active':'');b.dataset.kind=type;b.innerHTML=`<canvas width="48" height="48"></canvas><b>${type==='tank'?['Renault FT','A7V'][playerTeam]:type==='fighter'?(window.PXAW?.on?'Ataque ao solo':['SPAD XIII','Fokker D.VII'][playerTeam]):type==='bomber'?['DH-4 Liberty','Gotha G.V'][playerTeam]:d.name}</b><small>${d.sub}</small><span class="cost">◈ ${sandbox?'∞':d.cost}</span><kbd>${i+1}</kbd>`;b.onclick=()=>choose(type);$('cards').append(b);icon(type,b.querySelector('canvas').getContext('2d'))})}
function choose(type){if(!started){toast('Inicie uma operação para enviar reforços.');return}if(ended)return;if(type==='reinforce'){if(spend(type)){tickets[playerTeam]+=75;toast('+75 reforços disponíveis');hud()}return}placement=placement===type?null:type;makeCards();$('placehint').textContent=placement?`${defs[type].name}: clique no campo · ESC cancela`:'Escolha uma unidade e posicione no campo'}
